abstract: >-
  Shared stochastic epidemic and voluntary-protection dynamics, analysis modules,
  and stored-data reconstruction for Quarantine Games on Networks: Beyond Epidemic
  Establishment. This is an RC9.5 P10.4 reproducibility prerelease. The software is
  MIT licensed; the accompanying original scientific data and figures are CC BY 4.0.
